  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 401.03 Renewal Application. Each applicant for licensure renewal shall submit:\n\n(a) The “Universal Application for License Renewal” as required by Plc 308.05(a);\n\n(b) The “Addendum to the Universal Application for License Renewal” as required by Fors 401.05(b); and\n\n(c) The fee required by Plc 1002.16.\n\nSource. #5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97\n\nNew. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10087, eff 3-1-12; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
